ime.com and we'll be glad take your order\"","price_left":"\"$\", \"$22,612.50\"","specTableContent_left":" Item spec Series Santos Model Number WH100351 Size Ladies Case Material 18kt Rose Gold Dial Color Silver Dial with Roman Numerals Case Width 25mm Bezel Set with Diamonds Crown Crown Set with a Diamond Movement Swiss Quartz Clasp Type Pin Buckle Band Material Brown Leather Strap with Crocodile Pattern Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Water Resistant 30 meters/100 feet General Item # WH100351 MSRP $25,125.00 Brand Cartier","id_right":13223971,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11245245,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier\" \"CartierCartier Classic Santos Series Men's Watch W20099C4\"","description_right":" \"See a beautiful diamond watch or jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you FREE layaway plan. Just give us toll-free call 1-877-577-TIME send an email sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad take your order\"","price_right":"\"$\", \"$6,052.50\"","specTableContent_right":" Item spec Gender Mens Case Material Stainless Steel & Gold Dial Color Silver Bracelet Stainless Steel & Gold Clasp Hidden Folding Clasp Movement Automatic Bezel Fixed Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Case Back Solid Water Resistant 30m/100ft Case Diameter 32mm x 33mm Case Thickness 8.3mm General Item # W20099C4 MSRP $6,725.00 Brand Cartier"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":201,"row":{"pair_id":"17557475#3023143","label":0,"id_left":17557475,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":1631615,"brand_left":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio GPS & Heart Rate Watch Black - Large Strap\"@en Strap · TomTom Running ah\"@en","description_left":"\"\n\n24/7 Activity Tracking - Capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt.\nBuilt-in Heart Rate Monitor - Get accurate heart rate information on your wrist.\nGoal Setting - Challenge yourself to a daily or weekly target. Steps, calories, distance or active time. Set your goal and track your progress.\nMultisport Mode - Train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes.\nGPS Tracking - Track your speed, pace, distance, time and calories burnt.\nAutomatic Sleep Tracking - Know if you're getting the sleep you need.\n5 Heart Rate Training Zones - Train in 5 different zones to get results faster.\nRace Mode - Select one of your past performances to race against.\nInterval Training - Improve speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.\nIndoor Training Mode - Track your performance on the treadmill or in the gym.\n\nSports\n\n\nTreadmill - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nCycling - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration (Cadence - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nIndoor Cycling - Tracks heart rate, calories burnt and duration (Cadence, speed, pace and distance - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nSwimming - Tracks laps, distance, speed, duration, calories burnt and strokes\n\n\nFreestyle - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nGym - Tracks duration, heart rate and calories burnt\n\n\n\nActivity Tracking\n\nActivity Measurements - Steps, active minutes, distance, calories burnt and sleep\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nViews - Daily and weekly\n\n\nGoals - Steps, active minutes, distance or calories burnt\nTraining\n\n\nGoals - Time, distance or calories\n\n\nIntervals -Yes\n\n\nLaps - Time / Distance / Manual\n\n\nRace - Past activities, favorites and custom\n\n\nZone - Pace, heart rate or speed\n\n\n\nWeight and Dimensions\n\nBattery lifetime - Activity tracking: up to 3 weeks, GPS: up to 11 hours, GPS + Heart Rate: up to 9 hours\n\n\nDisplay resolution - 144x168\n\n\nDisplay size - 22x25 mm\n\n\nThickness - 13.7 mm\nWeight - 50 g\n\n\nWrist Size - 143-206 mm\nSensors\n\n\nSensors (internal) - Motion sensor (accelerometer + gyro), compass, optical heart rate monitor\n\n\nSensor (wireless) - Bluetooth® Smart\n\n\nAlerts - Beep & Vibrate\n\n\n\nWater Resistance\n\nWaterproofing - 40 m / 130 feet (5 ATM)\n\n\n\n\n\n \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":3023143,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1452348,"brand_right":"\"Garmin\"","title_right":" \" Garmin Forerunner 225 GPS Running Watch with Wrist-based Heart Rate \"Garmin | All Fitness Gadgets\"","description_right":"\"Know your zone with Forerunner 225 - the first Garmin GPS running watch with wrist-based heart rate. Now you have the option to run without a strap because this watch has a built-in sensor that measures heart rate at the wrist. A colorful gauge shows your zone and beats per minute at a glance: warm-up (gray), easy (blue), aerobic (green), threshold (orange) or maximum (red). Create customized workouts or download free training plans at Garmin Connect, send to your watch and get coach-like guidance. The 225 offers vibration alerts and a built-in accelerometer to record distance for treadmill workouts. Connected features include automatic uploads to Garmin Connect, live tracking and social media sharing. \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Manufacturer Garmin Brand Garmin Color Black/Red Model 010-01472-10 UPC 753759137632 Item Weight 0.12 pounds Item Size 11.3 x 1.9 x 1.9 inches Package Weight 0.4 pounds Package Size 3.6 x 2.6 x 2.6 inches Units in Package 1"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":202,"row":{"pair_id":"14272447#7217071","label":0,"id_left":14272447,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":761757,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Junghans Men's Meister Kalendar Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/4200.00) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"First built in the 1930s and improved into the 1960s to the watches we see in the collection today, the elegant Meister series of watches bear eloquent witness to Junghans� expertise in mechanical watchmaking, and the highest levels of their design, expertise and craftsmanship.\n\n\nThe Meister Calendar is a celebration of Junghans' expertise. The movement is a delight, an automatic movement featuring day, date, month and moonphase. This wealth of information is displayed elegantly, with no fuss and clutter, on a simple matt silver dial with baton markers and the simple Junghans logo. Covering the dial is curved plexiglass, with SICRALAN hardening to protect against scratches and knocks. The movement sits inside a simple, elegant stainless steel case, comfortably sized and curved to sit perfectly on the wrist, and is fastened on a soft, comfortable leather strap.\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7217071,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":3934485,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Bvlgari Bvlgari Soltempo Watch BB39WSPGD\" BB39WSPGD | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"Null\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":203,"row":{"pair_id":"4515022#9121094","label":0,"id_left":4515022,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1281015,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Facet 38 Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A409-2157) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This ladies Nixon The Facet 38 watch is made from stainless steel and is powered by a quartz movement. It fastens a silver metal  bracelet and has a purple dial. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9121094,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":183652,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Kensington Leather Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A108-1045) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Classic ladies Nixon The Kensington model with a PVD rose-plated case and a brown leather strap. The white dial is set with elegant baton markers.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":204,"row":{"pair_id":"7442419#6321256","label":0,"id_left":7442419,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":190840,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Junghans Men's Meister Pilot Automatic Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/3591.00) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"The high demands placed on timekeeping by aviation were first addressed by Junghans in the 1930s, when the company produced on-board clocks for air traffic use.\n\nThese were manufactured in level 7 of the now heritage-listed terrace building, the structure offered optimal lighting conditions for the delicate task of watchmaking. The classic instrument appearance of the cockpit was also reflected in the legendary Bundeswehr chronograph of 1955. The design of the Meister Pilot harks back to this: on the bi-directional rotating bezel the 12 distinctive, concave notches ensure a good grip as well as the unmistakable appearance of the timepiece. The screwed case back features a distinctive element: a specially-designed compass rose, which incorporates the symbolism of classic aviation in the form of an artificial horizon. The riveted leather strap ensures a secure fit on the wrist. The particular construction of the front assembly lends the timepiece an unusual elegance for a pilot watch – and the lightness required for take-off.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6321256,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":7986617,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Raymond Weil Tango Watch 8160-ST-00608\" \"Shop Raymond 5591-ST-20001 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Naperville’s favorite jeweler we offer a comprehensive selection of luxury watches.We are thrilled to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can rest assured that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted for comfort and they are known for their luxurious details. This 8160-ST-00608 Hard metal Gents Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":205,"row":{"pair_id":"7867430#16861644","label":1,"id_left":7867430,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":16674,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Hamilton Men's Jazzmaster Open Heart Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (H32565555) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This Swiss-made mens Hamilton Automatic watch has a hi-tech look, with a silver dial and areas of partially exposed mechanism set behind sapphire glass. The model fastens with a slim brown leather strap.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":16861644,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":16674,"brand_right":"\"Hamilton\"@en","title_right":" \"Hamilton American Classic JazzMaster Open Heart Mens Watch\"@en Watch - H32565555\"@en","description_right":"\"Sapphire Crystal Dial Window/ Buckle Clasp/ Stainless-Steel Case/ Dark Brown Leather Band/ Silver Dial/ Automatic Movement/ 50 Meters Water Resistant\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":206,"row":{"pair_id":"8062783#4876466","label":0,"id_left":8062783,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":9941809,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Alpina Automatic 4 Watch AL-525BS5AQ6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-525BS5AQ6B | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p>An intricate watch will never fail to convey sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Alpina brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can definitely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Rotating (diver time) bezel, this beauty represents delicate craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting Black dial color adds a pronounced sense of luxury. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Central 60 second hand, Date complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. It is also water resistant for 330 ft (100 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Alpina. We are available to clarify any specifications and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":4876466,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":13246304,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Parade Lyria Leaves Necklace P2771-R2-WRFS2\" \"Shop Parade N1976A-YG Necklaces | Mitchum Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p>Excite yourself not only with a touch of grace but a full experience of it, by wearing this radiant necklace from Parade. This Ladies’ necklace brings to you the meaning of effortless style.Reaching that catching look with this Gemstone, Diamond piece will surely be a breeze. Not to mention the Sapphire, Diamond that bring more splice of dazzle into your appeal, surely this item of beauty will make heads turn and looks linger on you. These Round stones will win the hearts of many, the way it has won yours. The material for it is 18k white gold, 18k rose gold.</p>\n<p>Mitchum Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Parade and their fantastic collections of Necklaces. We will be more than happy to assist you with your questions or purchases so call us or visits our stores.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":207,"row":{"pair_id":"1331598#11500484","label":0,"id_left":1331598,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1704048,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Gucci YA1264007 G-Timeless Mens Swiss Watch\"","description_left":" \" Gucci YA1264007 G-Timeless Mens Swiss Watch “Le Marché Des Merveilles” 38mm polished stainless steel case – Grey leather dial with snake print Dial bee index at 12 o’clock and 11 pyramidal indexes Stainless snapped back Case engraving strap ardillon buckle Silver colored hour minute hands Sapphire crystal antireflective coating ETA Quartz movement Water resistant to 5 ATM (50 meters/160 feet) Swiss made 100% original - authentic Brand new Comes box booklet warranty card serial number price tag watches come a 3 year from Watches-Swiss.com is also known as 462912 I18A0 8606","price_left":"\"621.00\", \"USD\"","specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11500484,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":7543534,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Michele Deco Watch MWW06P000100\" \"Shop Michele MWW06P000232 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This exceptional timepiece, model number MWW06P000100 from Michele provides beauty and top notch functionality for watch enthusiasts and average wearers alike. This Ladies timepiece combines performance and unmatched craftsmanship. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of reliable functionality and distinct style. A white dial provides an elegant contrast to the bold and captivating numbers. Its quartz (battery) movement offers excellence in technical innovation. This watch includes central 60 second hand, chronograph, date, day, small second hand complications. Its complications are distinctively positioned for easy reading. The numbers on this timepiece are in indexes, diamond style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The case is artfully crafted of gold plated stainless steel, both attention grabbing and is crafted to last. The watch’s gold plated stainless steel band is smooth and made out of the highest quality materials. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. It encircles the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 150 ft (50 meter) water resistance. The true showstopper of this piece is the diamonds that are located in the bezel, dial of this watch. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has sleek, elegant, and luxurious watches for any price level. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":208,"row":{"pair_id":"8062783#10794324","label":0,"id_left":8062783,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":9941809,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Alpina Automatic 4 Watch AL-525BS5AQ6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-525BS5AQ6B | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p>An intricate watch will never fail to convey sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Alpina brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can definitely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Rotating (diver time) bezel, this beauty represents delicate craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting Black dial color adds a pronounced sense of luxury. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Central 60 second hand, Date complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. It is also water resistant for 330 ft (100 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Alpina. We are available to clarify any specifications and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_