"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":210,"row":{"pair_id":"13578035#1052221","label":1,"id_left":13578035,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":268027,"brand_left":"\"Seiko\"","title_left":" \"Seiko Astron SSE047J1 watch\"","description_left":"\"            \t                    This Seiko Astron SSE047J1 watch is a gents watch. The beautiful solid colors will appeal to everyone this collection. The beautiful round form 45 mm and a bandwidth of 19 mm the models are elegant and exclusive. The model is equipped with a silver titanium case. The thickness of this beautiful case is 13.5 mm. The elegant watch has a grey dial. The model's crystal fitted is a strong and scratch resistant sapphire crystral. The new 8X53 Caliber Solar movement with chrono function charges on any form of light. The GPS time(zone) function will always show the correct time any where in the world. The water resistance of the watch is 10 ATM. Adequate for most aquatic sports, except scuba diving. 2 year guarantee on the movement. If necessary a tool is provided to shorten the strap of your watch. With a Seiko watch you know that you choose quality that is guaranteed by the vast knowledge and innovative power of the brand Seiko. In short, a brand with top reputation! WatchesnJewellery applies a trial period of 14 days. The model is not to your liking? Within 14 days, you can easily return the model. Buying online has never been so easy. If you wish to tackle the article Choose our packing service.            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":1052221,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":268027,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Seiko Astron Men's GPS Titanium Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SSE047J1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This gents Seiko Astron Gps watch has a titanium case and is fitted with a chronograph quartz movement. It is fastened with a silver metal  bracelet and has a off white dial.  The watch also has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":211,"row":{"pair_id":"7804395#14183421","label":0,"id_left":7804395,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":229512,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" DANIEL WELLINGTON Ladies Classy Sheffield 26mm Watch \"@en \"DANIEL DW00100068 £64.00 - TheWatchSuperstore.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Buy DANIEL WELLINGTON Ladies Classy Sheffield 26mm Watch DW00100068 for £64.00 Only!\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Case Material Stainless Steel Strap type Genuine Leather Strap Strap colour Black Water resistance 0 metres Movement Japanese Quartz Chronograph No MPN 0921DW Guarantee Daniel Wellington 2 year guarantee","id_right":14183421,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":518377,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" DANIEL WELLINGTON Men's Bristol 40mm Watch \"@en \"DANIEL DW00100009 £90.00 - TheWatchSuperstore.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Buy DANIEL WELLINGTON Men's Bristol 40mm Watch DW00100009 for £90.00 Only!\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Case Material PVD Rose Plating Strap type Genuine Leather Strap Strap colour Brown Water resistance 30 metres Movement Japanese Quartz Chronograph No MPN 0109DW Guarantee Daniel Wellington 2 year guarantee"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":212,"row":{"pair_id":"13124970#17557365","label":0,"id_left":13124970,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":519344,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Rolex 116710LN GMT-Master II Steel Watch\"@en Watches From SwissLuxury\"@en","description_left":"\"Rolex Oyster Perpetual Date GMT-Master II Watch40mm stainless steel case, bidirectional rotatable bezel with 24-hour engraved black Cerachrom insert, green 24 hour second time zone hand, independent 12 hour hand, black dial, and stainless steel Oyster Fliplock bracelet with Easylink 5 mm comfort extension link. Water resistant to 100 meters.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557365,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":10466027,"brand_right":"\"\n                        \n                            DKNY\n                        \n                    \"@en","title_right":" \"Crosswalk Stainless Steel Women's Watch \"@en \" Gray 'stanhope' Ceramic Bracelet","description_right":" \" A wide high-polished bezel frames the three-hand dial topping a smooth ceramic bracelet watch. Color: gray \"@en","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":213,"row":{"pair_id":"17524639#17378231","label":0,"id_left":17524639,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":109665,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Casio Ladies' Baby-G Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (BLX-100-7ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This stunning ladies Casio Baby-g watch has a stainless steel and resin stainless steel and resin case and is powered by a chronograph quartz movement. It is fitted with a white rubber strap and has a LCD dial.  The watch has a date function.  Includes alarm function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17378231,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":2041293,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Maurice Lacroix Les Classiques Watch LC6098-SS001-320-1\" \"Shop Maurice LC6158-SS001-330-1 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company we offer a vast selection of well-crafted watches.We are delighted to be a Maurice Lacroix retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Maurice Lacroix watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Maurice Lacroix watches are crafted for reliability and they are known for their attention to detail. This LC6098-SS001-320-1 Croco-calf Gents Maurice Lacroix watch features a With anti-reflective coating, Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":214,"row":{"pair_id":"7594352#9967770","label":0,"id_left":7594352,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":9040309,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Omega Speedmaster 311.30.42.30.01.005\"","description_left":"\"\n This Gents watch by Omega is a stunning piece designed to make you look active and stylish. It’s model number is 311.30.42.30.01.005, and the band material is Stainless steel. In addition, enhancing the look further is the Black-colored dial, making it an outstanding timepiece to be added to your collection. It also has a water resistance for up to 150 ft (50 meter). \nAs an authorized retailer of Omega, Albriton’s Jewelry in Jackson, Mississippi proudly brings you this timepiece with model number 311.30.42.30.01.005. Our retail store exclusively carries 100% authentic jewelry from the finest brands in the jewelry business. If you want more information about this item or any other general inquiries, feel free to reach us by phone, email or by visiting directly to our store. Our friendly staff will be ready to assist you with your inquiries.                                 \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9967770,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":4523241,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Omega Seamaster 212.30.44.50.03.001\"","description_right":"\"\nIt’s model number is 212.30.44.50.03.001, and the band material is Stainless steel. In addition, enhancing the look further is the Blue-colored dial, making it an outstanding timepiece to be added to your collection. It also has a water resistance for up to 1000 ft (300 meter). \nAs an authorized dealer of Omega, Albriton’s Jewelry in Jackson, Mississippi proudly offers you this timepiece with model number 212.30.44.50.03.001. Our retail store exclusively carries 100% authentic products from the finest designers in the jewelry business. If you want more information about this item or any other general inquiries, feel free to reach us by phone, email or by visiting directly to our store. Our friendly representatives will be ready to assist you with your inquiries.                                 \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":215,"row":{"pair_id":"15764555#17557301","label":0,"id_left":15764555,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":11213997,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Santos 100 W20073X8\" W20073X8 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\", \"\n                            Invented in 1904, the Santos was the first ever men's wristwatch, originally invented for aviation pioneer Alberto Santos-Dumont to make it easier to check the time while flying. The watch was a game-changer in the industry thanks to Santos-Dumont's huge popularity and fame, and to celebrate the origins of the timepiece, Cartier produced a wonderful series of Santos watches called the Santos 100. Modern Santos watches still maintain the classic hallmarks of the original, including the rounded square case, Roman numeral hour markers and fully incorporated lugs. \n                            \n                        \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £393.75 £3,150.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £196.87 £3,150.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £108.46 £3,390.54 £240.54 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £75.65 £3,510.90 £360.90 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £59.35 £3,636.30 £486.30 9.9%","id_right":17557301,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11216891,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Cartier Santos 100 Watch W20072X7\" \"Shop Cartier W20073X8 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This lustrous watch, model number W20072X7 from Cartier gives luxury and high tech functionality for watch lovers. This Gents timepiece adopts a distinctive design as well as classic watchmaking details. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the watch of insurmountable functionality and distinct style. A silver dial comes complete with intricate hour and minute markings that you’ll love. Its automatic (self winding) movement has unrivaled high-precision. This watch includes central 60 second hand complications. Its complications are distinctively positioned for easy reading. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The case is expertly created out of 18k yellow gold, both attention grabbing and structurally stable. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be found on your wrist. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 100 ft (30 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry knows exactly what features watch lovers adore. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":216,"row":{"pair_id":"2630150#12102121","label":1,"id_left":2630150,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1804997,"brand_left":"\"Tag Heuer\"","title_left":" \"Tag Heuer Carrera WAR201A.BA0723\" WAR201A.BA0723 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"This Tag Heuer has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Tag Heuer certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12102121,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1804997,"brand_right":"\"TAG Heuer\"@zh-hant","title_right":" \"暢銷款 TAG HEUER CARRERA（卡萊拉系列） Calibre 5星期-日曆 自動上鏈腕錶 100米 - ∅41毫米 WAR201A.BA0723 \"@zh-hant \"TAG Heuer（泰格豪雅） Carrera Automatic Watch 41毫米 | watch price\"@zh-hant","description_right":"\" Discover the TAG Heuer（泰格豪雅） Carrera Calibre 5星期-日曆 Automatic Watch 41毫米 WAR201A.BA0723 TAG Heuer Carrera（卡萊拉）Calibre 5星期-日曆腕錶：  細緻奪目。.\"@zh-hant ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":217,"row":{"pair_id":"4820505#11904492","label":0,"id_left":4820505,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":712172,"brand_left":"\"Junghans\"@en","title_left":" \"Max Bill Ladies´ Watch\"@en \"Junghans Max Watch 047/4659.00 nur € 495.00\"@en","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11904492,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":13545446,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Dior Chiffre Rouge Watch CD084510A001\" CD084B40R001 | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A finely crafted timepiece makes a magnificent statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical device, a fine timepiece can also add elegance to your look. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are delighted to offer a large selection of some of the worldâ€™s most beloved luxury watch brands, including Dior. We are also honored to be an authorized Dior retailer in Los Angeles. Dior's exquisite timepieces are built to endure. This Gents watch with model number CD084510A001 is part of the beloved Chiffre Rouge collection.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":218,"row":{"pair_id":"802486#3930509","label":1,"id_left":802486,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":451758,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Lady Black Reading silver\"@nl-NL silver 10:35 Horloge boektiek\"@nl-NL","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Meer informatie Prijs € 169,00 EAN 7350068244766 Merk Daniel Wellington Tijdsaanduiding Analoog Kleur wijzerplaat Zwart Geslacht Dames Materiaal kast Edel staal Vorm kast Rond Diameter kast 36 mm Dikte kast 6 mm Kleur kast Silver Materiaal Glas Mineraalglas Materiaal Band Leer Kleur band Zwart Breedte Band 18 mm Garantie 2 jaar Waterdicht 3 ATM","id_right":3930509,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":451758,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Lady Black Reading silver\"@nl-NL silver | 10:35 Horloge boetiek\"@nl-NL","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Meer informatie Prijs € 169,00 EAN 7350068244766 Merk Daniel Wellington Tijdsaanduiding Analoog Kleur wijzerplaat Zwart Geslacht Dames Materiaal kast Edel staal Vorm kast Rond Diameter kast 36 mm Dikte kast 6 mm Kleur kast Silver Materiaal Glas Mineraalglas Materiaal Band Leer Kleur band Zwart Breedte Band 18 mm Garantie 2 jaar Waterdicht 3 ATM"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":219,"row":{"pair_id":"8705003#9769981","label":0,"id_left":8705003,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":33479,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Polar M400 - Black HR\"@en \" Polar HR Accessories 90051341 \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Polar M400 HR - BlackThe Polar M400 HR GPS watch is for urban and trail runners who want a sporty design with advanced GPS and training features, along with loads of options to keep an eye on your activity.Track your pace, distance and altitude with the built-in GPS, and follow your 24/7 activity, calories and steps. You can also plan, sync and share your training with the Polar Flow mobile app and web service and set targets to beat your personal best.Find your way back home with Back to Start and train at the right intensity within your personal heart rate zones.Features Include:M400 training computerPolar H7 heart rate sensorUSB cablePolar M400 Getting Started Guide\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9769981,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":55974,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Polar Loop 2 - Smokey Black\"@en \" Polar Running Accessories Black \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    This wristband tracks your daily activity and even sleep, motivating and guiding you towards to better fitness and health. The Polar Loop 2 allows you to set individual daily activity goals so you can make the most of your workout, while unique technology allows the Loop to track your daily activity at five intensity levels: resting, sitting, low, medium and high so you can see how much progress you’re making. The soft and flexible wristband fits every wrist perfectly and features 85 individually placed LED lights to give you all the information you need. You can even wear the Loop 2 to bed and let it automatically track your sleep. Check Polar Flow app on your smartphone to see how long and well you slept. If you need a wake-up, the Loop 2 will gently vibrate when it's time to rise and shine.Features Include:Tracks your steps and distance.Free online tool for your coach or personal trainer to easily follow your progress.Add a Polar H7 Bluetooth Smart heart rate sensor for live accurate heart rate on your wrist.Smart Calories lets you know exactly how many calories you've burned.Activity Goal shows how active you've been during the day and gives you practical guidance.\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":220,"row":{"pair_id":"7867430#6734792","label":0,"id_left":7867430,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":16674,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Hamilton Men's Jazzmaster Open Heart Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (H32565555) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This Swiss-made mens Hamilton Automatic watch has a hi-tech look, with a silver dial and areas of partially exposed mechanism set behind sapphire glass. The model fastens with a slim brown leather strap.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6734792,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":12488014,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Orchard Gem Watch\"@en \"RumbaTime Orchard Watch | SHOPBOP SAVE UP TO 30% Use Code: MORE17\"@en","description_right":"\"\n            This RumbaTime watch has a thin silicone band supporting a faceted dial. A simple statement when worn alone, or a welcome addition to a stack of bracelets. Adjustable length and buckle closure.Water resistant to 30 meters.1-year manufacturer warranty.Imported, China.MEASUREMENTSDial: 1in / 2.5cmBand: 0.25in / 0.5cmLength: 6-8in / 15-20cm\n                    Style #RUMBA40058\n                \n\n                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":221,"row":{"pair_id":"1338589#16613646","label":0,"id_left":1338589,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":163505,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Men's Dapper 38mm Bristol Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DW00100090) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This men's Daniel Wellington Dapper 38mm Bristol watch is made from stainless steel and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fastened with a brown leather  strap and has a white dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":16613646,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11017613,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Bvlgari LVCEA Watch LU33C6SSPGD\" LU28C6SSPGD | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A luxury timepiece makes a brilliant statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical accessory, a fine timepiece can also add elegance to your look. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are proud to offer a large collection of some of the worldâ€™s most beloved luxury watch brands, including Bvlgari. We are also proud to be an authorized Bvlgari retailer in Los Angeles. Bvlgari's exquisite timepieces are built to last. This Ladies watch with model number LU33C6SSPGD is part of the unique LVCEA collection. It features a skillfully crafted Automatic (self winding) movement, Stainless steel, 18k pink gold band, and a Stainless steel bezel.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":222,"row":{"pair_id":"6530811#6658645","label":0,"id_left":6530811,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15615272,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Pasha W31079M7\" W31079M7 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £306.25 £2,450.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £153.12 £2,450.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £84.36 £2,637.14 £187.14 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £58.84 £2,730.74 £280.74 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £46.16 £2,828.18 £378.18 9.9%","id_right":6658645,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15556298,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Pasha W31029M7\" W31029M7 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Age 13 years (2003) Box Yes Papers Yes Watchfinder warranty 12 months* This watch is covered by our comprehensive 12 month warranty, giving you a full year of peace of mind. Delivery Free Returns policy 14 days* If you receive your watch in the post and don't like it, you have fourteen days from receipt to return it for a full refund. Product code 67953 Gender Unisex Movement Automatic Case size 35 MM Case material Steel Bracelet material Steel Dial type White Quarter Arabic Water resistance 30 metres"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":223,"row":{"pair_id":"724975#6220138","label":0,"id_left":724975,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":790009,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Alpina Automatic 4 Watch AL-525SS5AQ6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-525BS5AQ6B | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p>An elegant watch will always deliver sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Alpina brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can surely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Rotating (diver time) bezel, this treasure represents thorough craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting Silver dial color adds a bold sense of luxury. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Central 60 second hand, Date complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. It is also water resistant for 330 ft (100 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Alpina. We are available to answer your questions and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6220138,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":12672862,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Alpina Startimer Pilot Automatic Watch AL-525G4TS6\" \"Shop Alpina AL-525S4S4 | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p>An intricate watch will always deliver sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Alpina brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can surely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Polished bezel, this beauty represents delicate craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. The contrasting Black dial color adds a bold sense of luxury. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Central 60 second hand, Date complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Arabic, Indexes. This watch also comes with a 3 years warranty. It is also water resistant for 330 ft (100 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Alpina. We are available to answer your questions and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":224,"row":{"pair_id":"8914602#5910958","label":1,"id_left":8914602,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":175764,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Man Black Durham silver\"@nl-NL silver 10:35 Horloge boektiek\"@nl-NL","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Meer informatie Prijs €