ter_id_right":371437,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Lady Auto Watch H42215111\" H42215151\"","description_right":" it is also a remarkable piece of fine jewelry. This Ladies Hamilton H42215151 watch from the finely crafted American Classic Lady Automatic collection. It features precise (self winding) movement. Some other benefits this are that water resistant up to 150 ft (50 meter) and includes Scratch sapphire crystal. comes with generous 2 years international warranty. Are you looking for an exceptional gift? stylish timepiece spectacular way commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers thrilled be authorized retailer \" A trendy more than just practical telling time so can all our watches 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces designed endure will enjoyed come.","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":230,"row":{"pair_id":"9943517#7867430","label":0,"id_left":9943517,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":202373,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Hamilton Men's Khaki Below Zero 1000m Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (H78585333) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"High-impact mens Hamilton Khaki Below Zero model in all black, featuring date function, numeral hour markers, sapphire glass and a rubber strap.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":7867430,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":16674,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Hamilton Men's Jazzmaster Open Heart Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (H32565555) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This Swiss-made mens Hamilton Automatic watch has a hi-tech look, with a silver dial and areas of partially exposed mechanism set behind sapphire glass. The model fastens with a slim brown leather strap.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":231,"row":{"pair_id":"4960130#11383495","label":0,"id_left":4960130,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":8380584,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Suunto M2 - Black\"@en \" Suunto Accessories Black \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Monitor your heart rate and calories easily with the M2 watch, equipped with essential tools for reaching all of your fitness goals.Features Include:Real-time heart rate calories and training guidance.Automatically switches between three heart rate zones.Menu in nine different languages.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11383495,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1308165,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Fitbit - Surge Fitness Watch (Small) Black\"@en-US","description_right":"\"Fitbit Surge Fitness Watch (Small): Built with GPS tracking and continuous, wrist-based heart rate monitoring, Surge displays real-time workout stats like distance, pace, elevation climbed, and heart rate intensity, so you can make the most of your training.\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":232,"row":{"pair_id":"3098583#5053266","label":1,"id_left":3098583,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":2899740,"brand_left":"\"Omega\"","title_left":" \"Omega Seamaster Chrono Diver 2599.80.00\" 2599.80.00 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            The Seamaster is one of the most iconic diving watches of all time. Following from Omega's Marine in 1932, the world's first commercially available diving watch, the legend of the Seamaster officially debuted in 1948. By the time of 1957's 300M, it was among the most dependable and professionally sought dive watches from any brand, and it soon pioneered some of the sporty must-have features we associate with such watches, including unidirectional bezels, phosphorescent hands and the helium escape valve. This excellent model is a closely related sister watch to the version made famous by Pierce Brosnan as James Bond in 1995's GoldenEye—kicking off Bond's attachment to the Seamaster that continues to this day. \n                            \n                        \", \"This Omega has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Omega certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5053266,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":2899740,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Omega Seamaster 25998000\" \" Discover the Omega watch collection at Albemarle Bond","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":233,"row":{"pair_id":"8592684#14120469","label":0,"id_left":8592684,"category_left":"not found","cluster_id_left":101477,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio+Music DBL/PUR (Small) - Sky Captain Blue/Purple Haze\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Haze \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, track your heart rate and capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Cardio + Music.Store and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. Track your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor.A goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.Compatible with a wide range of Bluetooth headphones (available seperately) so you can listen without wires.Wireless syncing to your favourite apps such as TomTom MySports Strava Runkeeper Up Nike+ etc.QuickGPSFix technology finds your location quickly so you can start running sooner.Water resistant to 50m.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":14120469,"category_right":"not found","cluster_id_right":1588634,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio+Music DBL/LBL (Large) - Sky Captain Blue/Scuba Blue\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Blue \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, track your heart rate and capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Cardio + music.Store and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. Track your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor.A goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.Compatible with a wide range of Bluetooth headphones (available seperately) so you can listen without wires.Wireless syncing to your favourite apps such as TomTom MySports Strava Runkeeper Up Nike+ etc.QuickGPSFix technology finds your location quickly so you can start running sooner.Water resistant to 50m.\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":234,"row":{"pair_id":"14272447#15593897","label":0,"id_left":14272447,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":761757,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Junghans Men's Meister Kalendar Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/4200.00) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"First built in the 1930s and improved into the 1960s to the watches we see in the collection today, the elegant Meister series of watches bear eloquent witness to Junghans� expertise in mechanical watchmaking, and the highest levels of their design, expertise and craftsmanship.\n\n\nThe Meister Calendar is a celebration of Junghans' expertise. The movement is a delight, an automatic movement featuring day, date, month and moonphase. This wealth of information is displayed elegantly, with no fuss and clutter, on a simple matt silver dial with baton markers and the simple Junghans logo. Covering the dial is curved plexiglass, with SICRALAN hardening to protect against scratches and knocks. The movement sits inside a simple, elegant stainless steel case, comfortably sized and curved to sit perfectly on the wrist, and is fastened on a soft, comfortable leather strap.\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":15593897,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":508105,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Junghans Men's Meister Driver Chronoscope Automatic Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (027/3684.00) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"Inspired by the friendship between Erhard Junghans, Wilhelm Maybach and Gottlieb Daimler, and the elegance of the cars of the 1930's, drove the creation of the Meister Driver collection.\n\nThe dials are designed with the same passion and integrity of design and detailing as the Maybach DS 8 Zeppelin, an expression of pure elegance and luxury. The watch is inspired by this automobile, down to the layout and detail of the numerals, as well as the colour combination of anthracite, cream and light grey, popular for the bodywork of the cars. The dial is designed to evoke the style of the speedometers and dashboard clocks of these vehicles, with large numerals and large hands for optimal readability. The strap is soft, supple padded leather, in a similar colour to the interior of the Maybach, and features an automatic movement, with chronograph.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":235,"row":{"pair_id":"17557347#17557355","label":0,"id_left":17557347,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":854223,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Hamilton Seaview Day Date Auto H37565131\" \"Seaview Auto\"","description_left":"\"<p> Metals in Time is known for having a vast selection of stylish luxury timepieces, from the most trusted watch brands. We offer only top quality timepieces and we provide excellent service to go along with it. There is nothing quite as spectacular as owning a finely crafted watch. It makes a sophisticated statement and is as smart as it is practical. We know that watches come with a variety of features and functions and our skilled staff will help you navigate through our inventory to find the best timepiece to fit your needs. </p>\n<p> This H37565131 Hamilton watch is from the attractive Seaview Day Date Auto collection. Hamilton fine timepieces are both functional and stylish. This H37565131 Stainless steel Gents Hamilton timepiece includes a resilient Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking  for a stylish or casual  watch, we have just what you want. Shop with assurance knowing Metals in Time is an authorized Hamilton dealer. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557355,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":1005552,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Day Date Auto Watch H32505731\" H32505741\"","description_right":" it is also a enduring piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H32505741 watch comes from the finely crafted Day Date Auto collection. It includes accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Are you looking for an exceptional gift? timepiece thoughtful way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers privileged be authorized retailer so can all our watches are 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces built endure and will enjoyed years come. \" A exquisite more than just used telling time","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":236,"row":{"pair_id":"4966388#9169175","label":1,"id_left":4966388,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":4968146,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier\", \"CartierCartier Must 21 Series Men's Watch W10125U2\"","description_left":"\"See a beautiful diamond watch or a jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you our FREE layaway plan. Just give us a toll-free call on 1-877-577-TIME or send us an email to sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad to take your order\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Item spec Gender Mens Case Material Stainless Steel Dial Color Slate Grey Bracelet Black Rubber Clasp Deployant Clasp Movement Quartz Chronograph Bezel Fixed Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Case Back Solid Water Resistant 100m/330ft Case Diameter 38.5mm Case Thickness 10mm General Item # W10125U2 MSRP $4,350.00 Brand Cartier","id_right":9169175,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":4968146,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Must 21 W10125U2\" W10125U2 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"\n                            Cartier has been in business ever since Louis-François Cartier took over the Paris workshop of his mentor Adolphe Picard in 1847. Since then, the name Cartier has become synonymous with quality, luxury and grace. Known as one of the foremost purveyors of ultra-elegant jewellery, Cartier has long made superb watches as well—many with excellent mechanical pedigree. The company's glamorous reputation is justified by every model, crafted with a unique and unrivalled stylishness that continues to make it one of the most highly sought brands in the world. The superb Must 21 series is no exception, as seen in this model's stunning oversized bezel an dial patterned with the Cartier logo.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £225.63 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £112.81 £1,805.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £62.15 £1,942.85 £137.85 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £43.35 £2,011.85 £206.85 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £34.01 £2,083.73 £278.73 9.9%"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":237,"row":{"pair_id":"13321456#5072687","label":0,"id_left":13321456,"category_left":"not found","cluster_id_left":736023,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Casio ProTrek PRW-2500T-7ER\"@en PRW-2500T-7ER - Casio Pro Trek Watches\"@en","description_left":"\"