right":4480516,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Gent Quartz Watch H32451751\" \"Shop Hamilton Collection at Safa Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A trendy watch is more than just useful for telling time, it is also a incredible piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H32451751 watch comes from the ever popular Gent Quartz collection. It features a accurate Quartz (battery) movement. </p>\n<p> Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This luxury timepiece is a thoughtful way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is privileged to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can  all our watches are 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces are designed to last and will be loved for years to come. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":239,"row":{"pair_id":"13509760#17557310","label":1,"id_left":13509760,"category_left":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":16060096,"brand_left":"\"Samsung\"@en-US","title_left":" \"Samsung Gear Fit2 Smartwatch Large, Black\"@en-US \"Accessories - Page 194 | Roaming Free Sims\"@en-US","description_left":"\"When youâ€™re looking for motivation to stay at your best, the Samsung GearFit2 keeps you in the zone. It automatically recognizes whatever youâ€™re doing and starts monitoring steps, distance, Heart rate and more. You can even Map your run with the Accurate Built-in GPS. Receive and responds to notifications from your wrist and turn up the music that gets you moving. We all have goals. The Samsung GearFit2 will help you achieve yours.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557310,"category_right":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":16060096,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Gear Fit2 (Large) Black\"@en \"Galaxy S7 active 32GB (AT&T)\"@en","description_right":" \"Shatter-resistant screen** and IP68-certified dust water-resistant†\"@en","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":240,"row":{"pair_id":"270189#11614760","label":0,"id_left":270189,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":11213997,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Cartier Santos 100 Watch W20073X8\" \"Shop Cartier W20072X7 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This fine watch, model number W20073X8 from Cartier provides style and top notch functionality for your everyday fashion. This Gents timepiece features some of the most contemporary and useful features. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the timepiece of insurmountable functionality and exquisite style. A silver dial provides superior readability. Its automatic (self winding) movement features complications you’ll come to cherish. This watch includes central 60 second hand complications. Its complications greatly increase your watch’s functionality. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The case is artfully crafted of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 330 ft (100 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has sleek, elegant, and luxurious watches for any price level. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":11614760,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":7101,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Raymond Weil Toccata Watch 5988-P-97081\" \"Shop Raymond 5988-ST-97081 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company in Naperville, IL we offer a wide selection of well-crafted watches.We are happy to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can be sure that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted to last and they are loved for their luxurious details. This 5988-P-97081 Gold plated stainless steel Ladies Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":241,"row":{"pair_id":"10959814#852331","label":1,"id_left":10959814,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":474189,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Casio G-Shock GA-100-1A4ER\"@en GA-100-1A4ER - Casio Watches\"@en","description_left":"\"Casio G-Shock GA-100-1A4ER: shock-resistant, magnetic-resistant, countdown timer, stopwatch, daily alarm, 200-meter water resistance.\n\nAuto-LED light\nA light-emitting diode (LED) is used to illuminate the watch face, incl. the feature of an Auto Light Switch that illuminates the display when the watch is angled towards the face.\n\nShock-resistant\nShock-resistant construction protects against impact and vibration.\n\nMagnetic-resistant\nThe housing is designed to shield the clock from magnetic fields.\n\nWorld time function\nDisplays the current time in major cities and specific areas around the world.\n\nStopwatch function - 1/1000 sec. - 100 hours\nElapsed time, split time and final time are measured with 1/1000-sec accuracy. The watch can measure times of up to 100 hours.\n\nTimer - 1/1 min. - 24 hours (with automatic repeat)\nFor fans of precision: the countdown timers help you to remember specific or recurring events by giving off an audible signal at a preset time. They then count back automatically from the preset time. The time can be set to the nearest minute and up to 24 hours in advance. Ideal for people who need to take medicines every day or those who do interval training.\n\n5 daily alarms\nThe daily alarm reminds you about recurring events with an acoustic signal at the time you have set. This model has 5 independent alarms for flexible reminders of important appointments.\n\nSnooze feature\nEach time you stop the alarm, it sounds again after a few minutes.\n\nSpeed display\nThe average speed for a travelled route can be measured. Simply enter the distance at the start and press the stop watch when the destination has been reached - and the average speed is shown.\n\nAutomatic calendar\nOnce set, the automatic calendar always displays the correct date.\n\n12/24-hour timekeeping\nTimes can be displayed in either a 12-hour or 24-hour format.\n\nMineral glass\nThe tough mineral glass resists scratching.\n\nResin band\nSynthetic resin is the ideal material for wrist straps thanks to its extremely durable and flexible properties\n\n2 Years - 1 Battery\nThe battery supplies the watch with sufficient energy for approx. two years.\n\nWater resistance classification (20 bar)\nPerfect for free diving without scuba gear: the watch is water resistant up to 20 bar according to ISO 22810.\n\nChronometric precision\n+/- 15 Seconds per month\n\nDimensions\n55,0 mm x 51,2 mm x 16,9 mm (H x W x D)\n\nWeight\n72,0 g\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":852331,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":474189,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Casio Men's G-Shock Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (GA-100-1A4ER) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"High-impact mens Casio G-Shock model in oversized black resin, with red and white detailing. Features include chronograph, alarms, countdown timer, world time from a Japanese Quartz movement with perpetual calendar and date function, LED backlight, digital tachymeter,1/1000 stopwatch and the watch fastens with a sturdy rubber strap with double tang buckle for extra security. It is also shock resistant. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":242,"row":{"pair_id":"12206192#3537409","label":0,"id_left":12206192,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":184449,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Music BLK/ANT (Small) - Black/Anthracite\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Black/Anthracite \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Music.Store and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. A goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.Compatible with a wide range of Bluetooth headphones (available seperately) so you can listen without wires.Wireless syncing to your favourite apps such as TomTom MySports Strava Runkeeper Up Nike+ etc.QuickGPSFix technology finds your location quickly so you can start running sooner.Water resistant to 50m.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":3537409,"category_right":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_right":8018123,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 2 BLK/ANT (Small) - Black/Anthracite\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Black/Anthracite \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 wrist watch. The goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress so you can keep in control of your work outs, while the multisport mode lets you train in running, cycling, swimming, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":243,"row":{"pair_id":"11621482#15261802","label":0,"id_left":11621482,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":788022,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Raymond Weil Tango Watch 5391-ST-00995\" \"Shop Raymond 5960-ST-00300 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_left":"\"<p> At Naperville’s premier jeweler we offer a comprehensive selection of fine watches.We are delighted to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can rest assured that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted for precision and they are known for their luxurious details. This 5391-ST-00995 Stainless steel Ladies Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Wh