Barcelona\"@es ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":266,"row":{"pair_id":"606028#8210693","label":0,"id_left":606028,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":3141972,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Omega Speedmaster 311.92.44.51.01.003\"","description_left":"\"\n This Gents watch by Omega is a brilliant piece designed to make you look active and stylish. It’s model number is 311.92.44.51.01.003, and the band material is Fabric, Nylon. In addition, enhancing the look further is the Black-colored dial, making it an outstanding timepiece to be added to your collection. It also has a water resistance for up to 150 ft (50 meter). \nAs an authorized distributor of Omega, Albriton’s Jewelry in Jackson, Mississippi proudly offers you this timepiece with model number 311.92.44.51.01.003. Our retail store exclusively carries 100% authentic items from the finest brands in the jewelry business. If you want more information about this item or any other general inquiries, feel free to reach us by phone, email or by visiting directly to our store. Our expert jewelers will be happy to help you with your inquiries.                                 \" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8210693,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":12264187,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Omega Constellation 123.10.35.60.02.001\"","description_right":"\"\nIt’s model number is 123.10.35.60.02.001, and the band material is Stainless steel. In addition, enhancing the look further is the Silver-colored dial, making it an outstanding timepiece to be added to your collection. It also has a water resistance for up to 330 ft (100 meter). \nAs an authorized dealer of Omega, Albriton’s Jewelry in Jackson, Mississippi proudly offers you this timepiece with model number 123.10.35.60.02.001. Our retail store exclusively carries 100% authentic jewelry from the finest brands in the jewelry business. If you want more information about this item or any other general inquiries, feel free to reach us by phone, email or by visiting directly to our store. Our friendly representatives will be ready to assist you with your inquiries.                                 \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":267,"row":{"pair_id":"5910958#1793549","label":0,"id_left":5910958,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":175764,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Man Black Durham silver\"@en-GB silver 10:35 Watch boutique\"@en-GB","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" More Information Price €189.00 EAN 7350068244612 Brand Daniel Wellington Dial type Analogue Dial color Black Gender Men Case material Stainless steel Case shape Round Case diameter 40 mm Case thickness 6 mm Case color Silver Glass material Mineral glass Band material Leather Band color Brown Band thickness 20 mm Warranty 2 years Water resistance 3 ATM","id_right":1793549,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":3469,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Lady Glasgow silver\"@en-GB silver 10:35 Watch boutique\"@en-GB","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" More Information Price €139.00 EAN 7350068240430 Brand Daniel Wellington Dial type Analogue Dial color White Gender Women Case material Stainless steel Case shape Round Case diameter 36 mm Case thickness 6 mm Case color Silver Glass material Mineral glass Band material Nylon Band color Blue White Band thickness 18 mm Warranty 2 years Water resistance 3 ATM"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":268,"row":{"pair_id":"3098583#10574317","label":0,"id_left":3098583,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":2899740,"brand_left":"\"Omega\"","title_left":" \"Omega Seamaster Chrono Diver 2599.80.00\" 2599.80.00 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            The Seamaster is one of the most iconic diving watches of all time. Following from Omega's Marine in 1932, the world's first commercially available diving watch, the legend of the Seamaster officially debuted in 1948. By the time of 1957's 300M, it was among the most dependable and professionally sought dive watches from any brand, and it soon pioneered some of the sporty must-have features we associate with such watches, including unidirectional bezels, phosphorescent hands and the helium escape valve. This excellent model is a closely related sister watch to the version made famous by Pierce Brosnan as James Bond in 1995's GoldenEye—kicking off Bond's attachment to the Seamaster that continues to this day. \n                            \n                        \", \"This Omega has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Omega certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10574317,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":9376973,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Carl F Bucherer ScubaTec Watch 00.10632.23.53.01\" \"Shop Scubatec 00.10632.22.53.01 by Carl | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p>An elegant timepiece will never fail to express sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Carl F Bucherer brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can definitely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Rotating (diver time) bezel, this rarity represents delicate craftsmanship. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also evidence of the quality that comes from this stylish item. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Date, Central 60 second hand complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. </p>\n<p>This chic and classy watch from Carl F Bucherer has a Folding clasp type and sports a Automatic (self winding) movement. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. It is also water resistant for 1650 ft (500 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Carl F Bucherer. We are available to answer your questions and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":269,"row":{"pair_id":"14235954#9122080","label":0,"id_left":14235954,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1186111,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Seiko Astron Men's GPS Titanium Chronograph Solar Powered Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SSE025J1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This men's Seiko Astron Gps watch has a titanium titanium case and is fitted with a chronograph solar movement. It is fastened with a brown leather  strap and has a brown dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9122080,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":14081316,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Longines Conquest Watch L3.697.4.76.6\" \"Shop Longines L3.676.4.99.6 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This well crafted watch, model number L3.697.4.76.6 from Longines gives style and top notch functionality for watch enthusiasts and average wearers alike. This Gents timepiece only hints at the fine watchmaking within this timepiece. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of insurmountable functionality and exquisite style. A silver dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. This watch includes central 60 second hand, chronograph, date complications. Its complications are representative of this jeweler’s unique expertise of watches that take advantage of all of the space in the dial. The numbers on this timepiece are in arabic, index style, giving you readability and style. The clean round case is 44 mm. The case is expertly crafted of stainless steel, both attention grabbing and structurally stable. The watch’s stainless steel band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has a wide array of watches you can filter by exact features you’re looking for. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":270,"row":{"pair_id":"1914717#10760238","label":1,"id_left":1914717,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15145,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Garmin Unisex Forerunner 235 HR GPS Bluetooth Alarm Chronograph Watch\"@en \"Unisex Watch (010-03717-49) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"Stay on pace for your next personal record with Forerunner 235, the Elevate wrist-based heart rate monitoring, GPS and GLONASS equipped running watch with Bluetooth smart features.\n\nIts built-in activity tracker keeps recording steps, even when you’re not running allowing for heart rate based calorie computation. Pair your watch with a compatible phone for connected features like automatic uploads to Garmin Connect, smart notifications of calls, emails and messages, audio prompts and live tracking. You can also download customisable watch faces and applications from Connect IQ. \n\nMeasures heart rate at the wrist giving you the option to run without a strap. For more challenging runs, download advanced workouts and training plans to your watch from Garmin Connect.\n\n\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":10760238,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15145,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Garmin Forerunner 235 - Black Frost Blue\"@en \" Garmin Running Accessories & Blue \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Take the next step as a runner with this easy to use GPS watch that lets you track how far, how fast and how long you’re running. Instantly share your runs and tracking progress with friends, family and the world via social media by pairing a compatible device with Garmin Connect™ Network. Activity tracking counts steps and calories and reminds you when it’s time to move, while heart rate compatibility allows you to train with heart rate zones so you know when to push it on that last mile or when to reign it in.  Forerunner 235 is also compatible with GPS and GLONASS satellites which track your location, whether you are running out in the sticks or in the city.You can also receive weather forecasts and conditions via the app's wireless connectivity.Features Include:Connected features²: automatic uploads to Garmin Connect™ live tracking audio prompts music controls smart notifications and social media sharing.Tracks pace distance time heart rate¹ and more.Activity tracking³ counts calories distance daily steps and sleep.Download data fields watch faces widgets and applications from Connect IQ™\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":271,"row":{"pair_id":"3797242#15391935","label":0,"id_left":3797242,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":392854,"brand_left":"\"Raymond Weil\"@en-GB","title_left":" \"Raymond Weil Maestro Beatles Limited Edition Automatic Watch\"@en-GB Watch 2237-ST-BEAT2\"@en-GB","description_left":"\"MASTERS OF MUSIC\n\nAfter celebrating its 40th anniversary with The Beatles in 2016, music loving RAYMOND WEIL continues its collaboration with the world’s most famous rock band by releasing a watch paying homage to Abbey Road, the last album recorded by the legendary Fab Four and regarded by some as their most influential composition. This second limited numbered edition of 3,000 watches is a symbol of the timelessness of a group whose success and history are etched in our minds for eternity. \n\n“I’m a Beatles fan, like probably most other people, but it is true that I have become even more so through meeting the passionate collectors and fans of the band. I have come to grasp the respect and fascination they arouse in people and the impressive heritage that the group left to music. The Beatles have transcended time” said Elie Bernheim, CEO, RAYMOND WEIL. \n\nHoused in a 39.5mm steel case, the dial of the maestro 'The Beatles “Abbey Road” Limited Edition' is a copy of a vinyl record engraved with microgrooves.  Inspired by the iconic cover depicting The Beatles on the world famous pedestrian crossing, the outlined figures of John Lennon, Paul McCartney, George Harrison and Ringo Starr stride along the groove of their landmark record.\n\nAt the heart of the dial and on the sapphire crystal case-back of the watch, the most iconic logo in the music industry beats to the tempo of the mechanical self-winding RW200 movement.\n\nRAYMOND WEIL offers collectors and audiophiles a watchmaking classic with three hands, a date display and the timeless figures of those masters of music forever engraved in time and in the history of music.\n\nJoin the discussion on social media networks using #RWTheBeatles.\"@en-GB ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":15391935,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":682261,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Ladies Raymond Weil Noemia 24mm Diamond Watch 5124-ST-00985 \"Raymond Watches\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":272,"row":{"pair_id":"5463413#2338441","label":0,"id_left":5463413,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":477867,"brand_left":"\"Suunto\"@en","title_left":" \"SUUNTO AMBIT 3 PEAK BLACK\"@en BLACK - TREKKING GPS Suunto colour Black SS020677000 Athletic footwear apparel and sports equipment\"@en","description_left":"\"<p>Clock and GPS for Suunto sport model Ambit Peak 3 Black.<br>A GPS clock with advanced features for outdoor and multisport and mobile connection.</p>\n<p>SUUNTO AMBIT3 PEAK: THE ADVENTURE EXPERIENCE<br>The path to the destination is the most important thing – you speak of the mountains or a personal goal. Suunto Ambit3 GPS clock Peak is ideal for sport and adventure. Will guide you at every step, providing you with all the data needed to progress safely in your business. Connect the watch to your iPhone via bluetooth and using Suunto Movescount App to adjust the clock during the activity and to enrich, relive and share your experience. There isn't a better adventure companion to give importance to your every move.</p>\n<p>Main features:</p>\n<p>OUTDOOR AND MULTISPORT<br>-Navigation routes<br>-Operating time max. 50 h with GPS<br>-Compass<br>-Altitude (FusedAltiTM)<br>-Sunrise/sunset<br>-Temperature<br>-Heart rate monitor, swimming (with Suunto Smart Sensor)<br>-Recovery time depending on the activity<br>-Speed, pace and distance<br>-Bike Power Support (Bluetooth Smart)<br>-More sports in a single registration<br>-Training Programs<br>-New functions thanks to Suunto App</p>\n<p>CONNECTIVITY<br>-Upload and share your moves instantaneously (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones =<br>-Customize your watch during physical activity (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Time and GPS satellite data updated during physical activity (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Use your phone as a second display (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-See your calls, messages, and transfer notifications on the clock (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)</p>\n<p>ENRICH, RELIVE AND SHARE<br>-Take photos during your performance, showing the current speed, distance and other information (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Create a video on your Suunto performance with 3D map, key values and images (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)<br>-Share your experience instantly on social networks (with Suunto Movescount App and Smartphones)</p>\n<p>THE DEVICES COMPATIBLE WITH SUUNTO MOVESCOUNT APP ARE:<br>-3° generation iPad and more<br>-iPad iPad Mini/Air<br>-iPhone 4s/iPhone/iPhone 5 5 c/iPhone 5s<br>-5th generation iPod touch</p>\n<p>Dimensions:<br>50x50x18 mm.<br>Weight 89 gr.</p>\n<p>Package contents:<br>-Suunto Ambit3 Peak Black<br>-USB Cable<br>-Quick Guide<br>-Warranty information</p>\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" SKU SS020677000 Size S.T. Brand Suunto Product category Trekking Gps Color Black","id_right":2338441,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":7797639,"brand_right":"\"Suunto\"@en","title_right":" \"SUUNTO M2 MEN LIME\"@en apparel and sports equipment\"@en LIME - HEART RATE MONITOR Suunto colour SS020647000 Athletic footwear","description_right":"\"<p>Heart rate monitor Suunto M2 Black template files.</p>\n<p>Suunto heart rate monitor at a very attractive price! Ease of use thanks to a three-button interface, configurable software in Italian (nine languages available: Italian, English, French, German, Spanish, Dutch, Portuguese, Finnish, Swedish).</p>\n<p>A heart rate monitor, ideal for fitness, gym, running, cycling, and other sports where it is important to keep your heart rate monitored. Equipped by Dual Comfort Belt chest strap included in the package.</p>\n<p><strong>FUNCTIONS</strong><br>-Real-time heart rate<br>-Real-time Calories<br>-Guided Training in real time<br>-Three heart rate zones<br>-Automatic switching between three heart rate zones<br>-9 Menu languages</p>\n<p><strong>SPECIFICATIONS</strong><br>-30 m Water Resistant (according to ISO 6425)<br>-12 months battery autonomy in time mode<br>-Battery type: CR2032 (battery user-replaceable)<br>-Time and date Display<br>-daily alarm 1<br>-Dual time<br>-Stopwatch<br>-User interface Languages: EN, DE, ES, FI,? FR, IT, NL, PT, SV<br>-Button lock function<br>-Matrix Display<br>-Indicator low battery level<br>-Metric units or Imperial</p>\n<p>Colour: Black/Lime (cod. SS020647000)</p>\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" SKU SS020647000 Size S.T. Brand Suunto Product category Heart Rate Monitor Color No"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":273,"row":{"pair_id":"1051219#5647476","label":0,"id_left":1051219,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":440393,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Men's Classic 40mm Reading Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DW00100028) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This slim-line men's Daniel Wellington Classic 40mm Reading watch has a stainless steel case and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fitted with a black leather  strap and has a off white dial. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5647476,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":295356,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Daniel Wellington Men's Sheffield Silver 40mm Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (DW00100020) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This slim-line gents Daniel Wellington Sheffield Silver 40mm watch has a stainless steel case and is fitted with an analogue quartz movement. It is fitted with a black leather  strap and has a white dial. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":274,"row":{"pair_id":"6117739#2647130","label":0,"id_left":6117739,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":750167,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Raymond Weil Ladies' Nabucco BRIT Awards 2014 Limited Edition Titanium Automatic Chronograph Diamond Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (7700-TIR-BRIT14) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"The ladies� nabucco execution is designed using a 43mm titanium case that houses a dark grey dial featuring 11 diamond indexes, chronograph functions and a distinctive black watermarked �B� within the left sub dial. The timepiece has an ETA 7753 mechanical chronograph automatic self-winding mechanism. A touch of feminine elegance that has been added by the red trim has been added to the sub dials and is complemented by a vibrant red seconds hand and matching rubber strap.\n\n\nRaymond Weil has joined forces with internationally renowned German engineering sound specialists Sennheiser who have applied decades of experience and innovative science to create a special edition set of headphones entitled the �Bespoke Sennheiser Momentum Blacks� to accompany the Raymond Weil Limited Edition BRIT Awards timepieces in a unique exhibition watch box that celebrates Raymond Weil�s continued partnership with the BRIT Awards.\"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":2647130,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":8924707,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Raymond Weil Men's Maestro Beatles Limited Edition Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (2237-ST-BEAT1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"The Raymond Weil maestro Beatles Limited Edition features a Swiss mechanical selfwinding movement housed in a 39.5mm polished steel case.\n\nThe 13 Beatles’ album titles are written all around the bespoke dial, with a special \"Help\" index at 4 o’clock which matches the cover of the iconic album released in 1965. The silver galvanic dial matches the polished steel bracelet giving the watch a subtle but elegant look.\n\nIt features the official Beatles logo and a date window at 3 o’clock. Finally, the case back is a smoked sapphire crystal that carries the official Beatles logo and an engraved limited edition number. This unique timepiece paying tribute to the legendary Fab Four is limited to 3,000 pieces, with special packaging.\"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":275,"row":{"pair_id":"10549634#9058708","label":1,"id_left":10549634,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":209584,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Herren Skagen