. These <fine timepieces are designed to last and will be enjoyed for years to come. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557434,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":8896478,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Hamilton Jazzmaster Slim Auto Watch H38615555 \" \"Shop Hamilton Collection at Safa Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p> A stylish watch is not just useful for telling time, it is also a enduring piece of fine jewelry. This Gents Hamilton H38615555 watch comes from the skillfully crafted Slim Auto collection. It features a accurate Automatic (self winding) movement. Some other benefits of this watch are that it is water resistant up to 100 ft (30 meter) and includes a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal. This watch also comes with a generous 2 years international warranty. </p>\n<p> Are you looking for an exceptional gift? This fashionable timepiece is a spectacular way to commemorate any occasion. Safa Jewelers is privileged to be an authorized Hamilton retailer, so you can  all our watches are 100% authentic. These <fine timepieces are built to last and will be loved for years to come. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":277,"row":{"pair_id":"7095862#9121094","label":0,"id_left":7095862,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":148701,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Monopoly Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A325-1219) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This ladies Nixon The Monopoly watch is made from PVD gold plated and is fitted with a quartz movement. It is fitted with a gold tone metal  bracelet and has a silver dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9121094,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":183652,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Nixon Ladies' The Kensington Leather Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (A108-1045) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right