power up by simply setting your Gear S2 on the included wireless charging dock. Plus, with easily customizable watch faces, you can customize the Gear S2 to fit your unique style. With powerful capabilities and sleek looks, the Gear S2 will help you get the most out of your day.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":16864970,"category_right":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":2953072,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Samsung Gear S2 Classic - black smart watch with band 4 GB\" \" Samsung GB SM-R7320ZKAXAR Cell/Smart Phones CDW.com","description_right":"\"The Next Big Thing Is Here - Finally, a smartwatch thats designed for the speed of your life. With elegant curves and premium finishes, the Samsung Gear S2 classic will turn heads. The intuitive circular face and bezel let you navigate effortlessly to get to what you need. And with access to important notifications at a glance, you can get more out of every moment of your day with the Samsung Gear S2.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":283,"row":{"pair_id":"6891763#4791675","label":0,"id_left":6891763,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":18331,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Daniel Wellington Ladies' Southampton Rose 36mm Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (DW00100034) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This slim-line ladies Daniel Wellington Southampton Rose 36mm watch has a PVD rose plating case and is fitted with a quartz movement. It fastens a multicolour fabric strap and has a cream dial. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":4791675,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":372912,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Daniel Wellington Ladies' Classy Sheffield 26mm Watch\"@en \"Ladies' Watch (DW00100060) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This ladies Daniel Wellington Classy Sheffield 26mm watch has a PVD rose plating case and is fitted with a quartz movement. It fastens a black leather  strap and has a off white dial. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":284,"row":{"pair_id":"17557291#5536460","label":0,"id_left":17557291,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":12001728,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Chopard Mille Miglia Watch 168997-3001\" 158997-3001 | Dejaun Jewelers\"","description_left":"\"<p> A finely crafted timepiece makes a brilliant statement of style. While most people think watches are simply a practical device, a fine timepiece can also showcase your style. At Dejaun Jewelers, we are proud to offer a large selection of some of the worldâ€™s most beloved luxury watch brands, including Chopard. We are also proud to be an authorized Chopard retailer in Los Angeles. Chopard's unique timepieces are built to endure. This Gents watch with model number 168997-3001 is part of the unique Mille Miglia collection. The water resistance of this watch is 330 ft (100 meter).</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":5536460,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15224940,"brand_right":"\"Chopard\"","title_right":" \"Chopard LUC 161934-5001\" 161934-5001 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"\n                            L.U.C. stands for Louis-Ulysse Chopard, the brand's 19th-century founder, who is remembered for his extraordinary horological talents, creating masterpieces that wowed connoisseurs around the world. So it is no surprise that when the modern company, today run by family Scheufele, was looking to return to making prestigious, in-house movements in the 1990s, it named the resulting collection after its forefather and guiding light, L.U.C. This striking limited edition features a moonphase—a coveted complication under any circumstances, but here enhanced with both mechanical and artistic skill to create a magnificent and incredibly accurate orbital display for both hemispheres.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Chopard has undergone a thorough inspection of water resistance, accuracy, functionality and condition to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been referenced against technical documents and manufacturer records where available to ensure authenticity and a clean history.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":285,"row":{"pair_id":"17557284#17557415","label":0,"id_left":17557284,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":6747714,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Longines Conquest Watch L3.277.4.76.6\" \"Shop Longines L3.687.4.56.6 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This hand-crafted luxury watch, model number L3.277.4.76.6 from Longines offers luxury and top notch functionality for watch enthusiasts and average wearers alike. This Ladies timepiece expresses a flawless and sophisticated character. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of numerous functionality and distinct style. A silver dial was decorated to the highest standards in watchmaking. This watch includes central 60 second hand, date complications. Its complications will amaze you because of this piece’s technical precision. The numbers on this timepiece are in indexes, arabic style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The neat round case is 29 mm. The case is artfully created out of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s stainless steel band fits snugly and fashionably over your wrist. This watch's bezel features eye-catching stainless steel that speaks for itself. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry knows exactly what features watch lovers adore. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":17557415,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":7991496,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Longines Conquest Watch L3.700.4.96.6\" \"Shop Longines L3.687.4.76.6 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_right":"\"<p>This lustrous watch, model number L3.700.4.96.6 from Longines gives style and top notch functionality for your everyday fashion. This Gents timepiece only hints at the fine watchmaking within this timepiece. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is a watch of insurmountable functionality and exquisite style. A blue dial provides an elegant contrast to the bold and captivating numbers. This watch includes date, chronograph, central 60 second hand complications. Its complications greatly increase your watch’s functionality. The numbers on this timepiece are in arabic, index style, seamlessly fitting right in with the entire piece. The neat round case is 41 mm. The case is expertly crafted of stainless steel, both eye catching and structurally stable. The watch’s stainless steel band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This watch's bezel features gorgeous stainless steel that speaks volumes. This bezel is one for the ages and will always be found on your wrist. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has everything from simple timepieces to ones you’ll want to keep in the family forever. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":286,"row":{"pair_id":"11785599#8272385","label":0,"id_left":11785599,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1211681,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \" Seiko Men's Prospex GMT Diver Kinetic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (SUN021P1) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_left":"\"This large men's Seiko Prospex Gmt Diver watch has a stainless steel case and is powered by an analogue kinetic movement. It is fastened with a black rubber strap and has a black dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8272385,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":351844,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \" Raymond Weil Men's Freelancer Automatic Watch\"@en \"Men's Watch (2740-ST-50021) - WATCH SHOP.com™\"@en","description_right":"\"This men's Raymond Weil Freelancer watch has a stainless steel case and is powered by an analogue automatic movement. It is fitted with a silver metal  bracelet and has a blue dial.  The watch has a date function. \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":287,"row":{"pair_id":"12206192#6479456","label":0,"id_left":12206192,"category_left":"Sports_and_Outdoors","cluster_id_left":184449,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Music BLK/ANT (Small) - Black/Anthracite\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Black/Anthracite \"@en","description_left":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Music.Store and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. A goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.Compatible with a wide range of Bluetooth headphones (available seperately) so you can listen without wires.Wireless syncing to your favourite apps such as TomTom MySports Strava Runkeeper Up Nike+ etc.QuickGPSFix technology finds your location quickly so you can start running sooner.Water resistant to 50m.\n                                \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":6479456,"category_right":"not found","cluster_id_right":1553627,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Spark Fit - (Large) Black\"@en \" TomTom Black Accessories 1RE0.002.01 \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Track your way to a fitter, healthier you with the TomTom Spark Fit Cardio Fitness Watch. With 24/7 GPS activity tracking, the watch will capture everything you need to know about your lifestyle and exercise routine, including time, distance, calories burned and steps taken.Whether you’re playing tennis or going for a run, hitting the gym or going for a swim, you can take your workout one step further by setting yourself daily or weekly goals.Features Include:Tracks calories burned distance travelled pace speed steps taken and hours sleptWater-resistant design protects the watch in water or while you run in the rainWireless syncingFits large wrist sizesMultisport mode lets you track run bike swim gym and treadmill modesUltra-Slim designGoal setting to monitor daily and weekly goals\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":288,"row":{"pair_id":"6530811#15208038","label":0,"id_left":6530811,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15615272,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Pasha W31079M7\" W31079M7 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Name Monthly Repayment Total Amount Cost of Credit APR Interest Free Finance (6 Months) £306.25 £2,450.00 £0.00 0% Interest Free Finance (12 Months) £153.12 £2,450.00 £0.00 0% Classic Credit 24 Months 9.9% £84.36 £2,637.14 £187.14 9.9% Classic Credit 36 Months 9.9% £58.84 £2,730.74 £280.74 9.9% Classic Credit 48 Months 9.9% £46.16 £2,828.18 £378.18 9.9%","id_right":15208038,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15556298,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Pasha W31029M7\" W31029M7 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":289,"row":{"pair_id":"7265647#8592684","label":0,"id_left":7265647,"category_left":"not found","cluster_id_left":14503814,"brand_left":"\"TomTom\"@en","title_left":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio GPS & Heart Rate Watch Black - Small Strap\"@en Strap · TomTom Running ah\"@en","description_left":"\"\n\n24/7 Activity Tracking - Capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt.\nBuilt-in Heart Rate Monitor - Get accurate heart rate information on your wrist.\nGoal Setting - Challenge yourself to a daily or weekly target. Steps, calories, distance or active time. Set your goal and track your progress.\nMultisport Mode - Train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes.\nGPS Tracking - Track your speed, pace, distance, time and calories burnt.\nAutomatic Sleep Tracking - Know if you're getting the sleep you need.\n5 Heart Rate Training Zones - Train in 5 different zones to get results faster.\nRace Mode - Select one of your past performances to race against.\nInterval Training - Improve speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.\nIndoor Training Mode - Track your performance on the treadmill or in the gym.\n\nSports\n\n\nTreadmill - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nCycling - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration (Cadence - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nIndoor Cycling - Tracks heart rate, calories burnt and duration (Cadence, speed, pace and distance - through an optional cadence sensor)\n\n\nSwimming - Tracks laps, distance, speed, duration, calories burnt and strokes\n\n\nFreestyle - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nGym - Tracks duration, heart rate and calories burnt\n\n\n\nActivity Tracking\n\nActivity Measurements - Steps, active minutes, distance, calories burnt and sleep\nRunning - Tracks heart rate, speed, pace, distance, calories burnt and duration\n\n\nViews - Daily and weekly\n\n\nGoals - Steps, active minutes, distance or calories burnt\nTraining\n\n\nGoals - Time, distance or calories\n\n\nIntervals -Yes\n\n\nLaps - Time / Distance / Manual\n\n\nRace - Past activities, favorites and custom\n\n\nZone - Pace, heart rate or speed\n\n\n\nWeight and Dimensions\n\nBattery lifetime - Activity tracking: up to 3 weeks, GPS: up to 11 hours, GPS + Heart Rate: up to 9 hours\n\n\nDisplay resolution - 144x168\n\n\nDisplay size - 22x25 mm\n\n\nThickness - 13.7 mm\nWeight - 50 g\n\n\nWrist Size - 121-175 mm\nSensors\n\n\nSensors (internal) - Motion sensor (accelerometer + gyro), compass, optical heart rate monitor\n\n\nSensor (wireless) - Bluetooth® Smart\n\n\nAlerts - Beep & Vibrate\n\n\n\nWater Resistance\n\nWaterproofing - 40 m / 130 feet (5 ATM)\n\n\n\n\n\n \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":8592684,"category_right":"not found","cluster_id_right":101477,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"TomTom Runner 2 Cardio+Music DBL/PUR (Small) - Sky Captain Blue/Purple Haze\"@en \" TomTom Running Accessories Haze \"@en","description_right":"\"\n                                    Listen to music, track your heart rate and capture your steps, active minutes and calories burnt 24/7 with the Runner 2 Cardio + Music.Store and listen to over 500 songs on this ultra-slim, lightweight watch with 3GB storage to keep you motivated while you’re on the go. Track your heart rate on your wrist with the built-in heart rate monitor.A goal setting option lets you set your goal and track your progress, so you can keep in control of your work outs, while multisport mode lets you train in run, bike, swim, gym and treadmill modes. GPS is utilised to track your speed, pace, distance in real time and five different heart rate training zones help optimise your training and improve speed and fitness.  Winner of the product of the year ISPO Award 2016/2017 for the Performance category.Features Include:Automatic sleep tracking lets you know how much sleep you're getting each night.Audio performance feedback so you can stay on top of your game.Race mode lets you select one of your past performances to race against.Interval training improves speed and fitness with custom work-rest sessions.Track your performance on the treadmill and in the gym with the indoor training mode.Compatible with a wide range of Bluetooth headphones (available seperately) so you can listen without wires.Wireless syncing to your favourite apps such as TomTom MySports Strava Runkeeper Up Nike+ etc.QuickGPSFix technology finds your location quickly so you can start running sooner.Water resistant to 50m.\n                                \"@en ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":290,"row":{"pair_id":"3230904#417118","label":0,"id_left":3230904,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":451758,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Lady Black Reading silver\"@en-GB silver 10:35 Watch boutique\"@en-GB","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" More Information Price €169.00 EAN 7350068244766 Brand Daniel Wellington Dial type Analogue Dial color Black Gender Women Case material Stainless steel Case shape Round Case diameter 36 mm Case thickness 6 mm Case color Silver Glass material Mineral glass Band material Leather Band color Black Band thickness 18 mm Warranty 2 years Water resistance 3 ATM","id_right":417118,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":978026,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Daniel Wellington Classic Lady Black Bristol silver\"@en-GB silver 10:35 Watch boutique\"@en-GB","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" More Information Price €169.00 EAN 7350068244728 Brand Daniel Wellington Dial type Analogue Dial color Black Gender Women Case material Stainless steel Case shape Round Case diameter 36 mm Case thickness 6 mm Case color Silver Glass material Mineral glass Band material Leather Band color Brown Band thickness 18 mm Warranty 2 years Water resistance 3 ATM"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":291,"row":{"pair_id":"11618246#13509760","label":0,"id_left":11618246,"category_left":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":2953072,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Samsung - Gear S2 Classic Smartwatch 40mm Stainless Steel Black Leather\"@en-US","description_left":"\"Never miss a call or text with this Samsung Gear S2 Classic smartwatch, which features Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and NFC technologies for simple connection to the Web or your compatible Android,  iOS device.¹ Receive notifications and check your schedule, or stay active using S Health or Nike+ Running. The leather band offers a stylish look.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":13509760,"category_right":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":16060096,"brand_right":"\"Samsung\"@en-US","title_right":" \"Samsung Gear Fit2 Smartwatch Large, Black\"@en-US \"Accessories - Page 194 | Roaming Free Sims\"@en-US","description_right":"\"When youâ€™re looking for motivation to stay at your best, the Samsung GearFit2 keeps you in the zone. It automatically recognizes whatever youâ€™re doing and starts monitoring steps, distance, Heart rate and more. You can even Map your run with the Accurate Built-in GPS. Receive and responds to notifications from your wrist and turn up the music that gets you moving. We all have goals. The Samsung GearFit2 will help you achieve yours.\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":292,"row":{"pair_id":"15092873#965639","label":0,"id_left":15092873,"category_left":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_left":7598741,"brand_left":"\"Samsung\"@en-US","title_left":" \"Samsung Gear S2 Smartwatch - Silver\"@en-US \"Accessories Page 138 | Roaming Free Sims\"@en-US","description_left":"\"With elegant curves and premium finishes, the Samsung Gear S2 will turn heads. The circular interface and rotating bezel give you effortless navigation, so you can quickly access the things that are most important to you. This intuitive interface lets you easily access important notifications, texts, and updates from your phone with just a glance at your wrist. The built-in S-Health app tracks your steps, your heart rate, and even gives you a nudge when itâ€™s time to get moving. And with built-in wireless charging, itâ€™s easy to keep the Gear S2 powered up. Whether youâ€™re at home, work or anywhere in between, you can power up by simply setting your Gear S2 on the included wireless charging dock. Plus, with easily customizable watch faces, you can customize the Gear S2 to fit your unique style. With powerful capabilities and sleek looks, the Gear S2 will help you get the most out of your day.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":965639,"category_right":"Cellphones_and_Accessories","cluster_id_right":16221261,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Samsung Gear Fit2 activity tracker - 4 GB black\" \" Samsung black SM-R3600DANXAR Cell/Smart Phones CDWG.com","description_right":"\"When you're looking for motivation to stay at your best, the Samsung Gear Fit2 keeps you going. It automatically recognizes whatever you're doing-from walking up a flight of stairs to working out at the gym-and starts monitoring steps, distance and more. Map your run with built-in GPS, receive and respond to notifications from your wrist without breaking stride, and turn up the music that gets you moving. We all have goals. The Samsung Gear Fit2 will help you achieve yours.\" ","price_right":"\"$\", \"189.99\"","specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":293,"row":{"pair_id":"8787799#9959745","label":0,"id_left":8787799,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1259538,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Raymond Weil Freelancer Watch 2740-ST-20021\" \"Shop Raymond 7740-SC1-65221 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_left":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company in Naperville, IL we offer a large selection of luxury watches.We are happy to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can rest assured that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted for precision and they are purchased for their attention to detail. This 2740-ST-20021 Stainless steel Gents Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":9959745,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":20434,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Raymond Weil Freelancer Watch 7740-SC1-65221\" \"Shop Raymond 2754-SR-05500 Watches | Costello Jewelry Company\"","description_right":"\"<p> At Costello Jewelry Company in Naperville, IL we offer a large selection of well-crafted watches.We are honored to be a Raymond Weil retailer. As an authorized retailer, you can rest assured that every Raymond Weil watch we carry is 100% authentic and backed by a generous warranty.  Raymond Weil watches are crafted for precision and they are purchased for their attention to detail. This 7740-SC1-65221 Leather Gents Raymond Weil watch features a Scratch resistant sapphire crystal for worry-free wear. Whether you are looking for a watch that is stylish and sophisticated or casual and sporty we are confident that you’ll find just what you are looking for. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":294,"row":{"pair_id":"270189#12775484","label":0,"id_left":270189,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":11213997,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Cartier Santos 100 Watch W20073X8\" \"Shop Cartier W20072X7 Watches | Northeastern Fine Jewelry\"","description_left":"\"<p>This fine watch, model number W20073X8 from Cartier provides style and top notch functionality for your everyday fashion. This Gents timepiece features some of the most contemporary and useful features. </p>\n\n<p> \nThis is the timepiece of insurmountable functionality and exquisite style. A silver dial provides superior readability. Its automatic (self winding) movement features complications you’ll come to cherish. This watch includes central 60 second hand complications. Its complications greatly increase your watch’s functionality. The numbers on this timepiece are in roman numeral style, adding to this piece’s luxurious feel. The case is artfully crafted of stainless steel, both eye catching and is crafted to last. The watch’s alligator band was designed to be worn all day and still be comfortable to wear. This bezel is one that will not be forgotten and will always be by your side. It encloses the scratch resistant sapphire crystal of the watch. It has a 330 ft (100 meter) water resistance. </p>\n\n<p>Northeastern Fine Jewelry has sleek, elegant, and luxurious watches for any price level. For more information, call 1-855-795-NEFJ or email at info@nefj.com.</p>\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12775484,"category_right":"not found","cluster_id_right":29544,"brand_right":"\"Skagen\"","title_right":" \"Skagen 358SRRD Watch\"","description_right":"\"            \t                    Are you looking for a classic watch? Then the 358SRRD of Skagen is for you. The combination of the stainless steel case and stainless steel band ensures that you have a perfect quality watch. The watch has a water resistance of 3 ATM, splashproof.Washing hands and rain.. The rosegold colored dial allows for neutral, but perfect appearance. The rosegold colored band has a strikingly beautiful color. The model is covered with a strong mineral crystal.You receive 2 years warranty on the movement. If necessary a tool is provided to shorten the strap of your watch. A Skagen watch shows that you want something different than the rest of the world and choose for design and comfort of a perfect quality watch.\n            \t                    \n            \t                        Read more            \t                        Close            \t                        \n    \t                        \" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":295,"row":{"pair_id":"1796951#129009","label":0,"id_left":1796951,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":315882,"brand_left":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@es","title_left":" \"Bristol Oro Rosé Reloj para mujer 36mm\"@es \"Daniel Wellington Bristol 36mm nur 169 00 €\"@es","description_left":null,"price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":129009,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":563062,"brand_right":"\"Daniel Wellington\"@en","title_right":" \"Bristol Silver Ladies´ Watch 36mm\"@en \"Daniel Wellington Bristol 36mm nur € 169.00\"@en","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":296,"row":{"pair_id":"5648108#12979815","label":1,"id_left":5648108,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":11245245,"brand_left":"\"Cartier\"","title_left":" \"Cartier Santos W20099C4\" W20099C4 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12979815,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":11245245,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier\", \"CartierCartier Classic Santos Series Men's Watch W20099C4\"","description_right":"\"See a beautiful diamond watch or a jewelry on our site you'd like to buy but just don't have all the money right now? We can help by offering you our FREE layaway plan. Just give us a toll-free call on 1-877-577-TIME or send us an email to sales@icedtime.com and we'll be glad to take your order\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Item spec Gender Mens Case Material Stainless Steel & Gold Dial Color Silver Bracelet Stainless Steel & Gold Clasp Hidden Folding Clasp Movement Automatic Bezel Fixed Crystal Scratch Resistant Sapphire Case Back Solid Water Resistant 30m/100ft Case Diameter 32mm x 33mm Case Thickness 8.3mm General Item # W20099C4 MSRP $6,725.00 Brand Cartier"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":297,"row":{"pair_id":"15581012#130831","label":0,"id_left":15581012,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":1089077,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Couturier T035.210.11.051.00 Tissot Quartz Lady\"@en Lady official catalog Laguardajoiers dealer of in Barcelona\"@en","description_left":"\" Couturier T035.210.11.051.00 Tissot Quartz Lady. Tissot Watches and updated catalog with prices in Laguardajoiers, official dealer of Tissot watches in Barcelona. With several models to affirm a individual lifestyle. \"@en ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":130831,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":12247538,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Carl F Bucherer Peripheral Watch 00.10917.08.73.11\" \"Shop Carl 00.10917.08.83.11 | Moyer Fine Jewelers\"","description_right":"\"<p>An intricate watch will never fail to deliver sophistication and style- and this timepiece from Carl F Bucherer brings you just that. This Gents’ watch can surely be an awe-striking piece once you lay eyes upon it. With a Diamond bezel, this beauty represents thorough craftsmanship. Resting upon the Bezel are dazzling diamond stones that border the watch mesmerizingly. The Stainless steel case that encloses this piece’s mechanism is also proof of the quality that comes from this stylish item. Also important to note is the Scratch resistant sapphire crystal that protects the dial. With additional Small second hand, Date, Central 60 second hand complications to spice up this already brillliant timepiece, you’ll surely bring home a winner if you get yourself one of these beauties. </p>\n<p>This chic and classy watch from Carl F Bucherer has a Pin buckle clasp type and sports a Automatic (self winding) movement. The numbers in the face of the dial are in Indexes. It is also water resistant for 100 ft (30 meter). </p>\n<p>This watch is just one of the many impressive pieces we have in store for you. Moyer Fine Jewelers is an authorized dealer of Carl F Bucherer. We are available to answer your questions and look forward to hearing from you soon. </p>\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":298,"row":{"pair_id":"1192600#17557394","label":0,"id_left":1192600,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":15224940,"brand_left":"\"Chopard\"","title_left":" \"Chopard LUC 161934-5001\" 161934-5001 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_left":"\"\n                            L.U.C. stands for Louis-Ulysse Chopard, the brand's 19th-century founder, who is remembered for his extraordinary horological talents, creating masterpieces that wowed connoisseurs around the world. So it is no surprise that when the modern company, today run by family Scheufele, was looking to return to making prestigious, in-house movements in the 1990s, it named the resulting collection after its forefather and guiding light, L.U.C. This striking limited edition features a moonphase—a coveted complication under any circumstances, but here enhanced with both mechanical and artistic skill to create a magnificent and incredibly accurate orbital display for both hemispheres.\n                            \n                        \", \"This Chopard has undergone a thorough inspection of water resistance, accuracy, functionality and condition to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been referenced against technical documents and manufacturer records where available to ensure authenticity and a clean history.\" ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":" Age 1 year (2015) Box Yes Papers Yes Watchfinder warranty 12 months* This watch is covered by our comprehensive 12 month warranty, giving you a full year of peace of mind. Delivery Free Returns policy 14 days* If you receive your watch in the post and don't like it, you have fourteen days from receipt to return it for a full refund. Product code 71682 Gender mens Movement Automatic Case size 40 MM Case material Rose Gold Bracelet material Alligator - Black Dial type Silver Roman Numeral Water resistance 30 metres","id_right":17557394,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":15224940,"brand_right":null,"title_right":" \"Chopard L.U.C Lunar Twin 161934-5001\" LUC One 161927-5001\"","description_right":null,"price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":299,"row":{"pair_id":"2797828#1796357","label":0,"id_left":2797828,"category_left":"Jewelry","cluster_id_left":11213997,"brand_left":null,"title_left":" \"Cartier Santos De Cartier 100 \"@en","description_left":" this Cartier Santos automatic timekeeper is a part of history. The clean and sharp dial gives the watch very modern contemporary look keeping tradition black leather strap intact. It goes perfectly with any cocktail party outfit or for your daily wear. 33mm stainless steel case silver colour. blue sword shaped hour’s hand points at roman numerals. bracelet polished made screwed down links. Functions It’s water resistant up to 30m has push button fold over clasp. powered high precision self winding mechanical movement. purity elegance design what stands out in timepiece. \"@en was perfect help. Over years kept legacy alive designed variant original success. history speaks volumes brands rich legacy. Design Associated first manned flight that ever created \" Key Features Square Stainless Water Black Automatic movement Louis as piece machine which his dear friend Alberto could take during flights. Considering need wrist easily accessible time","price_left":"\"498000.00\"@en, \"2017-12-04\"@en, \"INR\"@en","specTableContent_left":" Collection Santos De Cartier Series Santos 100 Case Size 41.3 mm   Case Shape Square Case Material Steel Movement Automatic Strap Material Leather Strap Color Black Dial Colour White Gender Men Water Resistance (M) 100 Glass Material Sapphire Crystal Warranty Period 2 years","id_right":1796357,"category_right":"Jewelry","cluster_id_right":986795,"brand_right":"\"Cartier\"","title_right":" \"Cartier Santos W20098D6\" W20098D6 Watch | Watchfinder & Co.\"","description_right":"\"\n                            It was in 1904 that Louis Cartier gave a watch to his good friend and aviation pioneer Alberto Santos-Dumont that was designed to be worn on the wrist. The Santos watch was the first ever men's wristwatch, originally invented to make it easier to check the time while flying. It was a game-changer in the industry thanks to Santos-Dumont's huge popularity and fame, as well as a very early example of the iconic Art Deco style that would influence fashion and watchmaking for decades. The modern Santos watches maintain the classic hallmarks of the original, including the rounded square case, Roman numerals and fully incorporated lugs. \n                            \n                        \", \"This Cartier has undergone a thorough inspection of accuracy, functionality and condition at our Cartier certified service centre to determine the level of reconditioning required to meet our strict standards. It has also been checked against our records to ensure authenticity.\" ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":" Age 8 years (2008) Box Yes Papers Yes Watchfinder warranty 12 months* This watch is covered by our comprehensive 12 month warranty, giving you a full year of peace of mind. Delivery Free Returns policy 14 days* If you receive your watch in the post and don't like it, you have fourteen days from receipt to return it for a full refund. Product code 64231 Gender mens Movement Automatic Case size 35 MM Case material Steel Bracelet material Steel Dial type Silver Roman Numeral Water resistance N/A"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":1100,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}